Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:54.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}没事的  那些垂头丧气的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:55.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\c1E1E1E}也可爱无比
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.29,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对摇摆的蓝色烦扰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:16.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}面对诱惑魔法的引力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}明明如此  如此
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.84,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}努力地抗拒着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.84,0:21:21.34,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}可无论如何  不管怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:23.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)}最终还是会败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:26.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\t(1000,2200,\cC22331)}如果现在能重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.77,0:21:30.27,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}愿望如梦般短暂 {\fn\fscx\fscy}Rollin’
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.27,0:21:32.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}但人生很长
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.40,0:21:36.69,EDCN,,0,0,27,,{\fad(180,180)\cC22331}偶尔迷茫又何妨{\fnA-OTF Shin Maru Go Pr6N DB\fs68}？
